+// REGPU_REPLAY_RING_WRITES (live): a draw's upload-ring bytes (constants, index lists, vertex uploads) go into
+// its recorded command list and the replay thread copies them into the ring (RecordedList::RingBytes), so the
+// draw thread never writes the write-combined (or VRAM) ring itself. Set by DrawImpl for its own writes, on the
+// recording thread only (not on a draw worker, whose list is direct anyway).
